<TITLE>SRS Airbag Outline</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>Driver and front passenger SRS airbags, a driver SRS knee airbag, seat belts with pretensioner + force limiter, SRS side airbags and SRS curtain shield airbags are provided on all models.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>A communication and disposal processing function with a disposal tool has been provided for disposing of the airbags when scrapping the vehicle.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
